{"duration": 25.74, "cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 5.48, "text": "On the twenty-third of September\n2026, a tour boat filmed a young"}, {"start": 5.48, "end": 10.44, "text": "great white just north of Seal\nIsland in False Bay. The crew said"}, {"start": 10.44, "end": 13.77, "text": "it was the first they had seen\nthere in about eight years."}, {"start": 14.47, "end": 21.09, "text": "Six weeks later, on the third of November,\ntwo great whites swam up to a cage-diving"}, {"start": 21.09, "end": 25.74, "text": "boat off Gansbaai. They were the\ncompany's first in more than a year."}], "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.36, "text": "On"}, {"start": 0.36, "end": 0.5, "text": "the"}, {"start": 0.5, "end": 1.16, "text": "twenty-third"}, {"start": 1.16, "end": 1.22, "text": "of"}, {"start": 1.22, "end": 1.68, "text": "September"}, {"start": 1.86, "end": 3.08, "text": "2026,"}, {"start": 3.72, "end": 3.78, "text": "a"}, {"start": 3.78, "end": 4.02, "text": "tour"}, {"start": 4.02, "end": 4.34, "text": "boat"}, {"start": 4.34, "end": 4.86, "text": "filmed"}, {"start": 4.86, "end": 5.08, "text": "a"}, {"start": 5.08, "end": 5.48, "text": "young"}, {"start": 5.48, "end": 5.9, "text": "great"}, {"start": 5.9, "end": 6.3, "text": "white"}, {"start": 6.3, "end": 6.7, "text": "just"}, {"start": 6.7, "end": 7.06, "text": "north"}, {"start": 7.06, "end": 7.28, "text": "of"}, {"start": 7.28, "end": 7.52, "text": "Seal"}, {"start": 7.52, "end": 7.96, "text": "Island"}, {"start": 7.96, "end": 8.22, "text": "in"}, {"start": 8.22, "end": 8.46, "text": "False"}, {"start": 8.46, "end": 8.82, "text": "Bay."}, {"start": 9.6, "end": 9.7, "text": "The"}, {"start": 9.7, "end": 10.0, "text": "crew"}, {"start": 10.0, "end": 10.44, "text": "said"}, {"start": 10.44, "end": 10.8, "text": "it"}, {"start": 10.8, "end": 10.92, "text": "was"}, {"start": 10.92, "end": 11.12, "text": "the"}, {"start": 11.12, "end": 11.38, "text": "first"}, {"start": 11.38, "end": 11.6, "text": "they"}, {"start": 11.6, "e